+
+| Strategy | req/s | p50 ms | p95 ms | p99 ms | 201 / 409 / other | retries | overlaps / over capacity | invariants |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- | ---: | --- | :---: |
+| `advisory` | 1416 | 66.6 | 92.6 | 138.0 | 1106 / 26359 / 0 | – | 0 / 0 | ✅ |
